It doesn't ruin the message, but how one is supposed to run these
scripts is a bit beyond some of us newbie's capacities.

When I am outside plyr, and need to exclude variables that are
missing, I generally use a construction like:
subset(dfrm, !is.na <http://is.na>(var1) & !is.na <http://is.na>(var2), select=c(var1,var2, var_rest)

